{"3107270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holy Heroes", "steam_appid": 3107270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Holy Heroes</strong> is a cooperative game for one to four players, sharing the same screen on a single computer via keyboard and controllers (type PS4, Xbox and generics). Players can choose from 9 distinct hero classes (Knight, Dwarf, Barbarian, Wizard, Cleric, Ninja, Necromancer, Paladin, and Archer) to explore diverse floors and biomes in pursuit of main or side missions. The game features 9 spheres of power (Air, Water, Earth, Fire, Life, Death, Magic, Mind, and Nature) that influence monsters, enchantments, and enhancements, along with a variety of items to equip and use.<br><br>In addition to multiple floors to explore with increasing difficulty, the game includes traps, weather changes, portals, guardians, lever systems, and other elements that constantly demand players' attention, keeping them engaged.<br><br>•\tExplore procedurally generated worlds, always different.<br>•\tAcquire weapons, armor, shields, accessories, and more.<br>•\tDiscover your strategy by freely choosing your spells.<br>•\tForge and reforge items to always be prepared for any adversity.<br>•\tLearn special skills and acquire professions.<br>•\tComplete side quests while exploring the main mission's labyrinths.<br>•\tExperience day and night cycles, facing storms, fogs, and other challenges.<br>•\tAvoid traps and discover secret passages.<br>•\tUpon leveling up, enhance your heroes by deciding where to allocate points.<br>•\tNavigate through over twenty floors with various branches and biomes.<br>•\tEach floor may contain multiple levels.<br>•\tEncounter diverse monsters per biome and floor, with many creatures to discover in each unique world.<br>•\tPlay alone or with up to 3 friends by your side.<br>•\tShare gold and experience with your group, if desired.<br>•\tConfigure quick actions with up to 6 game commands.<br>•\tBecome a Sacred Hero!<br>•\tFor a challenging experience, we recommend Nightmare mode.<br>•\tBe careful, as playing with only one life is fatal!", "about_the_game": "<strong>Holy Heroes</strong> is a cooperative game for one to four players, sharing the same screen on a single computer via keyboard and controllers (type PS4, Xbox and generics). Players can choose from 9 distinct hero classes (Knight, Dwarf, Barbarian, Wizard, Cleric, Ninja, Necromancer, Paladin, and Archer) to explore diverse floors and biomes in pursuit of main or side missions. The game features 9 spheres of power (Air, Water, Earth, Fire, Life, Death, Magic, Mind, and Nature) that influence monsters, enchantments, and enhancements, along with a variety of items to equip and use.<br><br>In addition to multiple floors to explore with increasing difficulty, the game includes traps, weather changes, portals, guardians, lever systems, and other elements that constantly demand players' attention, keeping them engaged.<br><br>•\tExplore procedurally generated worlds, always different.<br>•\tAcquire weapons, armor, shields, accessories, and more.<br>•\tDiscover your strategy by freely choosing your spells.<br>•\tForge and reforge items to always be prepared for any adversity.<br>•\tLearn special skills and acquire professions.<br>•\tComplete side quests while exploring the main mission's labyrinths.<br>•\tExperience day and night cycles, facing storms, fogs, and other challenges.<br>•\tAvoid traps and discover secret passages.<br>•\tUpon leveling up, enhance your heroes by deciding where to allocate points.<br>•\tNavigate through over twenty floors with various branches and biomes.<br>•\tEach floor may contain multiple levels.<br>•\tEncounter diverse monsters per biome and floor, with many creatures to discover in each unique world.<br>•\tPlay alone or with up to 3 friends by your side.<br>•\tShare gold and experience with your group, if desired.<br>•\tConfigure quick actions with up to 6 game comman